+# QA plan ΓÇö R270: education date join fix in TXT/Markdown (production cv.zalize.com, bundle index-DjZrm45t.js)
+
+Change: resume.ts:2443 (TXT) and :2562 (MD) education dates now `[start,end].filter(Boolean).join(' ΓÇô ')` (was raw `${start} ΓÇô ${end}`). Education/TXT+MD only.
+
+Setup done: bundle confirmed served (HTML references index-DjZrm45t.js, asset 200); source verified. CDP on :29229, recording down (enigo) ΓåÆ screenshots.
+
+Fixture: resume with experience [start-only "Jan 2020"/blank end] and education entries:
+- E1 end-only: end "2014", blank start
+- E2 start-only: start "2017", blank end
+- E3 both: "2010" ΓÇô "2013"
+- E4 no dates
+
+## Tests (each byte-checked in downloaded TXT; broken build would show "( ΓÇô 2014)" / "(2017 ΓÇô )")
+1. TXT education lines:
+   - E1 ΓåÆ `(2014)` exactly; assert absence of `( ΓÇô 2014)` ΓÇö FAIL if dangling dash present.
+   - E2 ΓåÆ `(2017)` exactly; assert no `(2017 ΓÇô )` and no `2017 ΓÇô Present`.
+   - E3 ΓåÆ `(2010 ΓÇô 2013)`.
+   - E4 ΓåÆ school line has no parenthetical.
+2. Preview spot check: education dates render `2014`, `2017`, `2010 ΓÇô 2013` (unchanged), screenshot.
+3. PDF via pdftotext: same education values, no dangling dashes; no `Present` on education.
+4. Regression R268: experience preview + TXT contain `Jan 2020 ΓÇô Present`; TXT byte-exact `(Jan 2020 ΓÇô Present)`.
+5. Regression landing: saved dark pref ΓåÆ 2 loads, console errors [] (no #418), screenshot.
+6. 375├ù812 dark builder with fixture loaded: scrollWidth === 375, screenshot.
+7. Zero non-quota /api/ai/*; restore localStorage exactly ["honestcv.clientId","honestcv.qa"].
+
+## Results (run 2025, script /home/ubuntu/qa/r270.py, downloads /home/ubuntu/qa/dl_r270/)
+
+- Bundle: page resource entries include index-DjZrm45t.js only ΓÇö passed.
+- TXT byte-exact:
+  - `BSc Computer Science, University of Texas (2014)` ΓÇö no `( ΓÇô 2014)` ΓÇö passed
+  - `MSc Software Engineering, Austin College (2017)` ΓÇö no trailing dash, no Present ΓÇö passed
+  - `Diploma, Round Rock High School (2010 ΓÇô 2013)` ΓÇö passed
+  - `Certificate, Online Academy` ΓÇö no parenthetical ΓÇö passed
+  - grep count of `( ΓÇô ` / `ΓÇô )` in file: 0 ΓÇö passed
+- Preview: 2014 / 2017 / 2010 ΓÇô 2013 render, no dangling-dash forms (r270_preview_edu.png) ΓÇö passed.
+- PDF (pdftotext): 2014, 2017, 2010 ΓÇô 2013, no education Present, no dangling dash lines ΓÇö passed.
+- Regression R268: experience `Jan 2020 ΓÇô Present` in preview and TXT line 8 `(Jan 2020 ΓÇô Present)` ΓÇö passed.
+- Regression landing dark pref: 2 loads, console errors [] (no #418) (r270_landing_dark.png) ΓÇö passed.
+- 375├ù812 dark builder: scrollWidth 375, class dark, errors [] (r270_375_dark_builder.png) ΓÇö passed.
+- Zero non-quota /api/ai/*; localStorage restored exactly ["honestcv.clientId","honestcv.qa"]; system theme (r270_cleanup_final.png) ΓÇö passed.
+
+- Markdown (MD download button, UI): line 17 `### BSc Computer Science, University of Texas *(2014)*`, `*(2017)*`, `*(2010 ΓÇô 2013)*`, no-dates entry has no parenthetical; experience `*(Jan 2020 ΓÇô Present)*`; zero dangling-dash matches ΓÇö passed.
+
+No P0ΓÇôP3 findings. Recording unavailable (enigo init failed, down since R166) ΓÇö CDP screenshots.
